---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import { COMPANY, CONTACT_LINKS, PRODUCTS } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms that apply when you use the Nirvigna website."
  lastUpdated="8 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    These terms apply to your use of this website, operated by {COMPANY.legalName} (“{COMPANY.brand}”, “we”, “us”). By using the
    website you agree to them. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.
  </p>

  <h2>1. What this website is</h2>
  <p>
    This website describes our company and our products. {PRODUCTS.compliance.name} is in early access and
    {PRODUCTS.foodSafety.name} is in development. Descriptions of how they work may change as they are built.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Not legal advice</h2>
  <p>
    Content on this website is general information only. It is not legal, tax or professional advice, and using the website does
    not create a professional relationship between you and us. Regulated filings are done by a qualified CA/CS. See our
    <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    We try to keep the website accurate and up to date, but laws and rules change, and we do not promise that every part of the
    website is complete, current or free of errors.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not use the website for anything unlawful.</li>
    <li>Do not try to disrupt the website, get around its security or send automated or bulk submissions through the contact form.</li>
    <li>Do not send us personal data about other people without their permission.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The website’s content, design and the {COMPANY.brand} name belong to us or are used with permission. You may view and share
    pages for your own non-commercial use, but not copy or republish them without our written permission.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Links to other services</h2>
  <p>
    Some links open services run by others, such as WhatsApp (run by Meta). Their own terms and privacy policies apply, and we
    are not responsible for them.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss arising from your use of, or reliance on, this website. Nothing
    in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Personal data</h2>
  <p>How we handle personal data is set out in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of India. <Placeholder text="[PLACEHOLDER: jurisdiction clause to be settled in legal review]" />
  </p>

  <h2>10. Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms by posting a new version on this page. Questions: <a href={CONTACT_LINKS.email}>{COMPANY.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
